<title>SOUTH AFRICA: King Foods says talks continuing.</title>
<headline>King Foods says talks continuing.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>King Food Holdings Ltd said on Friday that talks, first announced on October 22, were continuing.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement was made in due course. No further details were given in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
